==History==
2016
*The Bowler [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/7/2016, in the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]].
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bowler's cost to 5 [[Elixir]] (from 6 Elixir), decreased his hitpoints by 7%, and decreased his damage by 10%.
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], changed his description. The description used to say "''This big blue dude digs the simple things in life - Dark Elixir drinks and throwing rocks. His massive boulders bounce off their target, landing behind for a double strike.''"
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], changed the Bowler's sound effects.
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
*On 5/12/2018, the [[Version History#December 2018 Update (5/12/2018)|December 2018 Update]], increased the Bowler's range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles). This change was not mentioned in any change notes and was later said to be unintentional by Supercell, and as such it got reverted in 7/12/2018, in a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/12/2018)|maintenance break]].
2019
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Bowler's card info screen.
2020 
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bowler's range to 4 tiles (from 5 tiles), increased his projectile range to 7.5 tiles (from 6 tiles), and increased his hitpoints by 8%.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Bowler from Frozen Peak to Rascal's Hideout.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], added the I'm Throwing Rocks Tonight [[Card Mastery]] task for the Bowler.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Bowler's hitpoints by 0.04% and his damage by 0.34%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Bowler's projectile range to 7 tiles (from 7.5 tiles)

