==Trivia== 
*The Bowler is 1 of 19 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Minions]], [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Balloon]], [[Golem]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Phoenix]], [[Lava Hound]], and the [[Archer Queen|Archer Queen.]]
**The Bowler resembles the Level 1-2 Bowler from Clash of Clans.
**The Bowler was originally a troop idea for Clash Royale, but being scrapped, he was transferred to Clash of Clans. Ultimately, the Bowler was added in one of Clash Royale's updates.
**The Bowler's description is very similar to his description in Clash of Clans. Before the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], the description erroneously stated the Bowler's boulders bounce, which do in Clash of Clans, but not in Clash Royale.
***There is also a [[Loading Screen Hints|Loading Screen Hint]] that is similar to its [[Cards|card]] description.
**In Clash Royale, the Bowler's bowling action resembles a more conventional underhand style of bowling, like that seen in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ten-pin_bowling ten-pin bowling], for example, as opposed to in Clash of Clans, where he hurls his boulder overhand, resembling that of a bowler in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cricket cricket].
***In the Russian, Chinese, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Bowler's name translates to "Bouncer", "Boulder Pitcher", and "Stone Goalkeeper" respectively.
**In Clash of Clans, the Bowler has glowing red eyes and yellow sclerae, however in Clash Royale, the Bowler has normal eyes and sclerae.
**The Bowler's [[Cards|card]] render is taken from his Clash of Clans counterpart's old render.
*Among all troops that attack with projectiles, the Bowler has the lowest projectile speed of all troops, with a projectile speed of 170.
*The Bowler is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the Archers, [[Knight]], Goblins, [[Bomber]], Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Bats]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Rascals]], [[Musketeer]], Giant, Valkyrie, Wizard, [[Flying Machine]], Hog Rider, [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], [[Baby Dragon]], [[Skeleton Army]], Witch, P.E.K.K.A, [[Prince]], Balloon, [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], Wall Breakers, Cannon Cart, [[Mega Knight]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], Lava Hound, [[Night Witch]], and [[Fisherman]].
*The Bowler is 1 of 23 cards that has had its [[Elixir]] cost changed, the others being Bomber, [[Fire Spirit]], Royal Recruits, [[Cannon]], [[Mortar]], Musketeer, [[Three Musketeers]], [[Heal]], [[Goblin Hut]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Barbarian Hut]], [[Furnace]], [[Elixir Collector]], Skeleton Army, P.E.K.K.A., Wall Breakers, [[Electro Giant]], [[Goblin Barrel]], [[Barbarian Barrel]], [[Rage]], Fisherman, and the [[Monk]].
*The Bowler has been confirmed to be a Goblin. Despite this, he does not belong to the Goblin class.
*The Bowler is 1 of 15 troops which bring an excited reaction from the audience upon spawning and brings a collective groan from the audience when defeated, as well as a concerning gasp when the opponent plays him, the others include [[Royal Giant]], Giant, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, [[Rune Giant]], Goblin Giant, Golem, [[Electro Wizard]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Sparky]], Lava Hound, Night Witch, [[Super Lava Hound]], and the Monk.
*The Bowler's rock can be seen can be seen on the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]] as a decoration.
*The Bowler says “''Bowling!''” upon spawn. He may also say “''Buh-bye''”, “''He-he-hoor!''”, "''Strike''", and/or “''Rolling, rolling, rolling!''” while attacking. He also passively hums while walking.
** The Bowler is voice acted by [https://www.imdb.com/name/nm5354454/ Lucas Schuneman].
**The Bowler is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Mega Minion]], Wizard, Hog Rider, P.E.K.K.A., [[Dark Prince]], Ram Rider, Electro Wizard, [[Princess]], Ice Wizard, Magic Archer, [[Lumberjack]], [[Mother Witch]], Fisherman, [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], Archer Queen, [[Little Prince]], and the [[Terry]].
*The Bowler, along with the Minions, Bomber, Skeletons, [[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Ice Spirit]], Mini P.E.K.K.A, Mega Minion, [[Ice Golem]], Dart Goblin, Elixir Golem, [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], [[Guards]], Baby Dragon, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, Golem, Wall Breakers, [[Executioner]], Mega Knight, Inferno Dragon, Royal Ghost, Lava Hound, and the [[Skeleton King]], are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Monsters monster] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*The [[Card Mastery]] task "I'm Throwing Rocks Tonight!" is a reference to a quote from [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Big_Lebowski The Big Lebowski].
*According to Vlad Perge, the Community Manager of Clash Mini, the Bowler is his favorite troop, as stated on [https://www.pocketgamer.com/clash-mini/interview-fan-fang-vlad-perge/ Pocket Gamer].
*The Bowler is the subject of 4 [[Emotes]].
*The Bowler was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/pRfrjMiHbQA?si=P2kVLJUlXH1SZoHm Clash Royale League 2021 Tournament], by a player called Mugi.
*On 3/1/2024, the Bowler was supposed to receive a first attack time interval increase to 0.6 seconds (from 0.5 seconds), but this change [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-55-balance-wip was pulled back last minute].

